<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#08283d"><title>Acceso · Hostal Delfines</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link href="vendor/fontawesome-free/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="css/sb-admin-2.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="css/delfines.css" rel="stylesheet"></head><body class="delfines-auth"><main class="auth-shell"><aside class="auth-brand"><a href="acceso.jsp" class="app-brand"><span class="brand-monogram" aria-hidden="true">HD</span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>Hostal Delfines</strong><small>Sistema de gestión</small></span></a><div><div class="auth-line"></div><h1>Hospitalidad junto al mar.</h1><p>Una operación clara y serena para cada estancia.</p></div><small>Recepción · Gestión · Control</small></aside><div class="auth-panel-wrap"><section class="auth-panel"><span class="page-kicker">Acceso · Empleado</span><h1>Iniciar sesión</h1><p>Ingresa tus credenciales para continuar.</p><c:if test="${not empty error}"><div class="notice notice-error" role="alert"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i><span><c:out value="${error}"/></span></div></c:if><form action="SvLoginEmpleado" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrfToken}"><div class="field"><label for="usuario">Usuario</label><input type="text" id="usuario" name="usuario" autocomplete="username" required></div><div class="field auth-password"><label for="clave">Clave</label><input type="password" id="clave" name="clave" autocomplete="current-password" required><button type="button" class="password-toggle" data-password-toggle="clave" aria-label="Mostrar clave" aria-pressed="false"><i class="fas fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Ingresar <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></form><div class="auth-alt"><a href="acceso.jsp">Elegir perfil</a><span>·</span><a href="loginAdmin.jsp">Acceder como admin</a></div></section></div></main><script src="js/delfines-ui.js"></script></body></html>
